<view class="page"><view class="row"><text class="title">知序</text><text class="link" bindtap="login">账户与连接</text></view><view class="hero">把学术需求，<br/>说清楚。</view><view class="sub">三项服务，明确范围。提交需求后，由专人确认材料与报价。</view><view class="demo" wx:if="{{source==='demo'}}">本地演示内容 · 当前服务暂时不可达</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{services}}" wx:key="id"><view class="number">0{{index+1}} / SERVICE</view><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="sub line">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.description}}</view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="create">说明需求</button></view><view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!services.length}}"><view>暂无可用服务</view><button bindtap="reload">重新加载</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="workspace">查看我的需求与订单</button><view class="sub line small">具体费用、交付内容与修改次数，以本人确认的报价为准。</view></view>
